ion by inhibiting 'Lys-48'- but facilitating 'Lys-63'-linked ubiquitination (PubMed:38016475)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}